<title>USA: PepsiCo sees Q3 EPS $0.30 below yr-earlier.</title>
<headline>PepsiCo sees Q3 EPS $0.30 below yr-earlier.</headline>
<dateline>PURCHASE, N.Y. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>PepsiCo Inc said Thursday it expected earnings per share for the third quarter to be about $0.30 below the same period last year.</p>
